<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Connecticut 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>round-robin Phoenix/ATP Tour World Doubles Championship on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>Sebastien Lareau (Canada)/Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Libor</p>
<p>Pimek (Belgium)/Byron Talbot (South Africa) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe)/Grant Connell (Canada) beat Jonas</p>
<p>Bjorkman (Sweden)/Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-3 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia)/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat</p>
<p>Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Mark Knowles (Bahamas)/Daniel Nestor (Canada) beat Trevor</p>
<p>Kronemann (U.S.)/David Macpherson (Australia) 6-3 4-6 6-3</p>
</text>
